Changes: substantially extended with engineering content (superconducting magnet, homogeneity, shielding, quench, gradient electrical/mechanical limits, eddy currents, PNS, RF tuning, SAR, wavelength effects, receive arrays, signal/noise estimates, ADC dynamic range) and Python demos; all numbers are typical orders of magnitude.*
